{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"48811","name":"Warwick Reine Astrid - Lyon","description":"This charming hotel offers a tranquil escape near the renowned Parc de la Tête d'Or, featuring a zoo, lake, and botanical garden. Situated on the bustling Boulevard des Belges, it's surrounded by shopping and entertainment, yet provides a peaceful retreat. The commercial center, Cité Internationale, and Interpol are a short drive away. Renovated in 2021, this elegant hotel offers 88 suites across 7 floors. Guests enjoy a welcoming atmosphere and comfortable services, including a 24-hour reception desk, currency exchange, and lift in the impressive, air-conditioned foyer. A conference room, internet access, a cozy café, a bar, and a restaurant are also available. Room and laundry services, along with parking, are provided for guest convenience. The modern, tastefully decorated suites feature private bathrooms, hairdryers, direct-dial telephones, satellite TV, internet access, and central heating. A kitchenette, minibar, microwave, tea and coffee making facilities, and a king-size or double bed are also included. Each suite boasts a balcony with stunning garden views. Leisure options include a sauna and sport room (currently closed for refurbishment, reopening planned for January 2024). A breakfast buffet is served daily. À la carte and set menus are available for lunch and dinner, offering delicious cuisine. Please note, the restaurant and bar are closed on Saturdays and Sundays.","address":"Boulevard Des Belges, 24/26","city":"LYON","countryCode":"FR","postalCode":"69006","lat":45.7749878810052,"lng":4.84765471424907,"stars":4,"chain":"WARWI","giataCode":"20069","phone":"+33472821897","email":"infora@warwickhotels.com","website":"www.warwickastrid.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/04/048811/048811a_hb_a_038.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/04/048811/048811a_hb_a_036.jpg","category"